{"id": "section-body-26643", "title": "Obsessive-Compulsive Disorder", "chapterId": "chapter-twenty-three", "blocks": [{"id": "body-26643", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Obsessive-Compulsive Disorder", "runs": [{"text": "Obsessive-Compulsive"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Disorder"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "359"}}, {"id": "body-26644", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "This condition is characterized by the presence of persistent intrusive thoughts or concerns, and is usually associated with compulsions, which are mental acts or behaviours which an individual engages in to attempt to get rid of the obsessions and/or decrease his or her distress i.e. excessive hand washing. Obsessive thoughts and compulsions may interfere with daily functioning. The features are usually distressing to the patient.", "runs": [{"text": "This condition is characterized by the presence of persistent intrusive thoughts or concerns, and is usually associated with compulsions,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "which"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "mental"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "acts"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "behaviours"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "which"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "an"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "individual"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "engages"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "attempt"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "get"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "rid"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "obsessions"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and/or decrease his or her distress i.e. excessive hand washing. Obsessive thoughts and compulsions may interfere with daily functioning. The features are usually distressing to the patient."}]}, {"id": "body-26646", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Clinical Presentation", "runs": [{"text":